        <briefdescription>
<para>Clean up resources. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Release resources that may be causing issues:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Close unused connections</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Clear caches</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Free temporary memory</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Close file handles</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true if cleanup was successful </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Must be thread-safe </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
